{"id":"82c921b871f2639b","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-turing-machine.md","title":"Finite Turing Machines","display":"df-turing-machine — Finite Turing Machines","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-turing-machine","aliases":["90-df-turing-machine"],"display":"df-turing-machine — Finite Turing Machines","depends_on":["[[90-df-omega]]","[[90-df-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-turing-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-turing-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-machine — Finite Turing Machines"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4badec96813b3395\" href=\"?note=4badec96813b3395\" title=\"90-df-relation\">90-df-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\rangle\">\\(M=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\rangle\\)</span> 为候选八元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma\">\\(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma\\)</span> 是有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 是符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 是函数图。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm L,\\mathrm R\">\\(\\mathrm L,\\mathrm R\\)</span> 是两个不同的方向标记。</li>\n<li>本文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 是有限程序数据的可定义类；类成员式按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TMData}\">\\(\\operatorname{TMData}\\)</span> 展开，不要求任意标签的所有有限机器组成集合。通用双向纸带运行见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ffc504ac94bd0528\" href=\"?note=ffc504ac94bd0528\" title=\"90-df-tm-halts\">90-df-tm-halts</a>；原 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3953b8fffc6e6551\" href=\"?note=3953b8fffc6e6551\" title=\"90-df-configuration\">90-df-configuration</a> 给同一数据类型另配半无限纸带运行语义，二者不默认为同一运行关系。</li>\n<li>投影只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 时使用；停机状态必须互异且均不同于初态。接受和拒绝都属于停机。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{TMData}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n&amp;\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\ \\Bigl[\nM=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land |Q|&lt;\\infty\\land|\\Gamma|&lt;\\infty\\land\\varnothing\\ne\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{B\\}\\land B\\in\\Gamma\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\}\\subseteq Q\n\\land|\\{q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\}|=3\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathrm L,\\mathrm R\\}\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{TM}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{TMData}(M)\\},\\\\\n(Q_M,\\Sigma_M,\\Gamma_M,B_M,\\delta_M,q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M)\n&amp;\\coloneqq M,\\\\\nH_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\{q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{TMData}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n&amp;\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\ \\Bigl[\nM=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land |Q|&lt;\\infty\\land|\\Gamma|&lt;\\infty\\land\\varnothing\\ne\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{B\\}\\land B\\in\\Gamma\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\}\\subseteq Q\n\\land|\\{q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\}|=3\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathrm L,\\mathrm R\\}\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{TM}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{TMData}(M)\\},\\\\\n(Q_M,\\Sigma_M,\\Gamma_M,B_M,\\delta_M,q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M)\n&amp;\\coloneqq M,\\\\\nH_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\{q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 保留八元组的分量次序和调用名。有限状态、字母表可作有限重命名；没有将第 90 本的具体数值程序 e 直接等同于这里的抽象机器。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"4badec96813b3395","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-tm-halts","status":"resolved","id":"ffc504ac94bd0528","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本文件的 $\\mathrm{TM}$ 是有限程序数据的可定义类；类成员式按 $\\operatorname{TMData}$ 展开，不要求任意标签的所有有限机器组成集合。通用双向纸带运行见 [[90-df-tm-halts]]；原 [[90-df-configuration]] 给同一数据类型另配半无限纸带运行语义，二者不默认为同一运行关系。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"3953b8fffc6e6551","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本文件的 $\\mathrm{TM}$ 是有限程序数据的可定义类；类成员式按 $\\operatorname{TMData}$ 展开，不要求任意标签的所有有限机器组成集合。通用双向纸带运行见 [[90-df-tm-halts]]；原 [[90-df-configuration]] 给同一数据类型另配半无限纸带运行语义，二者不默认为同一运行关系。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm L,\\mathrm R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TMData}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{TMData}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n&\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\ \\Bigl[\nM=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land |Q|<\\infty\\land|\\Gamma|<\\infty\\land\\varnothing\\ne\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{B\\}\\land B\\in\\Gamma\\\\\n&\\land\\{q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\}\\subseteq Q\n\\land|\\{q_{\\mathrm{start}},q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\}|=3\\\\\n&\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\})\\times\\Gamma\n\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathrm L,\\mathrm R\\}\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{TM}&\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{TMData}(M)\\},\\\\\n(Q_M,\\Sigma_M,\\Gamma_M,B_M,\\delta_M,q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M)\n&\\coloneqq M,\\\\\nH_M&\\coloneqq\\{q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2345,"backlinks":[{"id":"61f71a91e63627ba","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · dep